{"3673960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Akiiwan: Relaxing Survival", "steam_appid": 3673960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Fishing, New Lore and More!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/52e4adb395c72e7dd03e30cb616deda6.avif?t=1787585304\" width=851 height=1101 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌎 Explore a Hand-Painted World </strong>– Stunning hand-crafted biomes that change with each new moon. Just when you think you’ve got it figured out, there’s something new to discover!   <br>   <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎶 Real Nature - Recorded in Canada’s North </strong>– The sounds you hear in the game are real! Our lead sound engineer lives in a fly-in community in the North and has been field recording them for years. You will feel like you’re there too! <br> <br>🧭<strong>Never Get Lost </strong>– No minimap to watch - you don’t need it. Explore freely and when you’re done for the day, fast travel back to camp from anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐻 Don’t Look Over Your Shoulder </strong>- The animals won’t attack you (well, unless you really, really antagonize them). Who needs fake animal attacks - the true depth of and ingenuity of real survival is fun enough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>🍲 No need to eat every 30 seconds </strong>– You only eat once a day at your fire, so you can focus on <i>being</i> in the world, rather than 4 different level meters. <br> <br><strong>🆘 Get Gifts and Hints from your fire </strong>– Think of the fire like a grandparent: they want you to become independent, but they’ll help you out too. Of course you can always test your skill without their help in a challenge mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲No Cutting down trees </strong>– You have to build up your stores for winter, but instead of chopping down everything in sight, you can auto-harvest fallen trees from the woods (in real survival, chopping down a tree would be a terrible waste of energy if you could avoid it)<strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>🌙 Make Progress Fast </strong>– Each Night you get to unlock new quests and lore from the fire. You can upgrade your camp, process and even fast-craft overnight  <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌟Go deep into Crafting - with the stars </strong>– Each new craft unlocks an animated sequence in the night sky where you discover how it’s really built. Exciting for those of us who love to nerd out on cool details, but totally skippable for those who also just want to get on with the next day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌎 Explore a Hand-Painted World </strong>– Stunning hand-crafted biomes that change with each new moon. Just when you think you’ve got it figured out, there’s something new to discover!   <br>   <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎶 Real Nature - Recorded in Canada’s North </strong>– The sounds you hear in the game are real! Our lead sound engineer lives in a fly-in community in the North and has been field recording them for years. You will feel like you’re there too! <br> <br>🧭<strong>Never Get Lost </strong>– No minimap to watch - you don’t need it. Explore freely and when you’re done for the day, fast travel back to camp from anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐻 Don’t Look Over Your Shoulder </strong>- The animals won’t attack you (well, unless you really, really antagonize them). Who needs fake animal attacks - the true depth of and ingenuity of real survival is fun enough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>🍲 No need to eat every 30 seconds </strong>– You only eat once a day at your fire, so you can focus on <i>being</i> in the world, rather than 4 different level meters. <br> <br><strong>🆘 Get Gifts and Hints from your fire </strong>– Think of the fire like a grandparent: they want you to become independent, but they’ll help you out too. Of course you can always test your skill without their help in a challenge mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲No Cutting down trees </strong>– You have to build up your stores for winter, but instead of chopping down everything in sight, you can auto-harvest fallen trees from the woods (in real survival, chopping down a tree would be a terrible waste of energy if you could avoid it)<strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>🌙 Make Progress Fast </strong>– Each Night you get to unlock new quests and lore from the fire. You can upgrade your camp, process and even fast-craft overnight  <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌟Go deep into Crafting - with the stars </strong>– Each new craft unlocks an animated sequence in the night sky where you discover how it’s really built. Exciting for those of us who love to nerd out on cool details, but totally skippable for those who also just want to get on with the next day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.poster.avif?t=1787585304\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.webm?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.mp4?t=1787585304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fall into a chill survival adventure, with a talking campfire as your guide. Explore, craft, fish and hunt during the day, and ask your fire three questions each night. Choose wisely: Winter isn't the only surprise in this beautiful, hand-drawn world. Playable in cosy or realistic mode.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“Art, Atmosphere, and a World That Breathes. Designed for Short Sessions and Busy Lives.”<br>Shadow Domain<br><br>“It became apparent very quickly that the near-meditative state the game enveloped you with from the start stood in too sharp a contrast to the sensory assault of a buzzing game conference floor.”<br>Playing This Week<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/cfc75f1c6be0e220add5fd893734c6152f5cf9dd/header.jpg?t=1787585304", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/ddb2f920c4f6c5fa9cb704454c3ddab85cbd5ab9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787585304", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/ddb2f920c4f6c5fa9cb704454c3ddab85cbd5ab9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787585304", "website": "https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/littlebuffalostudios/akiiwan-chill-survival-game-with-a-talking-camp-fire/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+ 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inte Core i-8600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon Only (A18 pro or M1+)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Copyright 2021-26 Little Buffalo Studios Inc. All Rights Reserved", "developers": ["Little Buffalo Studios"], "publishers": ["Little Buffalo Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 4605910, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "2